                <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontColor=#000000;fontSize=11;" value="Solid boxes are built and verified. Dashed boxes are still to do (the TCP modules are skeletons with their ports).&lt;br&gt;Every stream between blocks is 64 bit AXI-Stream with tkeep, tuser on tlast marks a frame to drop. Receive has no tready.&lt;br&gt;Each layer takes its header off with hdr_strip and puts it on with hdr_insert, the number is the header length in bytes." vertex="1">
